      "value": "<p>NCAA Division I sports teams practice and play using these facilities. Athletic students are pleased to find many recreational facilities, such as the Alex G. Spanos Center, the Janssen-Lagorio Gymnasium, and the Chris Kjeldsen Pool Complex.</p>",
