      "title": "Student Life",
      "value": "<p>Famous music artists perform on campus throughout the year. Students run around 150 student clubs that reflect a range of interests, and there are 12 sports clubs to ensure something for everyone. The center for identity and inclusion offers resources and support networks to people from different backgrounds, amplifying the integrative focus of the diverse campus community.</p><p>The Pacific Tigers compete in NCAA Division I athletics, so many students support their local team by cheering them on at regular games. Introverted students might like to browse the literary selection at the campus bookstore and spend alone time in the library. People from all walks of life find a home at the University of the Pacific.</p>",
